{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kubikiri Cycle: The Blue Savant and the Nonsense User","It's the vacation of a lifetime, a trip to a remote island filled with geniuses–and murder.\n\n\n\nOn Wet Crow's Feather Island, a tiny speck in the Sea of Japan, lives Akagami Iria, the exiled daughter of a powerful family. Born into great wealth, she was a princess of the highest pedigree–until she was cut off by the leader of the Akagami Foundation. For the last five years, she's lived on Feather Island with her maids. But she hasn't been alone. She has invited the best minds Japan has to offer to come and stay with her.\n\n\n\nAnd so nineteen-year-old college student Ii-chan and his best friend, computer genius Kunagisa Tomo, find themselves as Iria’s guests at her elaborate mansion. Surrounded by fascinating women – a chef, a fortune-teller, a scholar, and an artist, not to mention his own friend Tomo – Ii-chan is feeling a little overmatched intellectually. But the sudden discovery of a grisly murder sends the island into shock. And Ii-chan discovers that he does possess a bit of genius: the ability to discover what is real and what is fake, who is who they claim to be and who is a killer.\n\n\n\n(Source: Del Rey Manga)"],"ja":["クビキリサイクル 青色サヴァンと戯言遣い",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-33263","ids":{"shikimori":33263,"mal":33263,"anilist":21803,"kodik":"serial-12673"},"kodikIds":["serial-5915","serial-8101","serial-12673"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-5915":"2023-09-11T18:09:41Z","serial-8101":"2020-04-13T01:17:17Z","serial-12673":"2018-10-07T23:01:52Z"},"title":"Зарэгото: Обезглавливающий цикл","originalTitle":"Kubikiri Cycle: Aoiro Savant to Zaregotozukai","alt":"Цикл обезглавливания: Синий Савант и Повелитель Бессмыслицы / Обезглавливающий цикл: Синий савант и Повелитель бессмыслиц Kubikiri Cycle: The Blue Savant and the Nonsense User クビキリサイクル 青色サヴァンと戯言遣い","description":"Сюжет, о котором нам поведает данное аниме, будет рассказываться от первого лица. Главный герой, вопреки своей воле и желаниям, постоянно оказывается втянут в какие-то истории с убийствами и загадками и вечно вовлечен в гущу событий. Как ни пытается он избежать этого, судьба не на его стороне, так что приходится ему впрягаться в ярмо и стараться отыскать ключи к тайнам. Вот только, сколько бы усилий он ни прилагал, как бы ни старался, в итоге оказывается, что всё, что бы он ни сделал, — всё тщетно.","year":2016,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","тайна","Сверхъестественное","взрослые персонажи"],"rating":7.75,"popularity":45276,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/33263/b82018c94fd4890891f55127bf306826.jpeg","width":700,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21803-C1VsrA5tDcfI.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-2228","dubId":"2228","label":"Freedub Studio","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-5915","translationId":"2228","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/158381/eea004fdac269c991deeb2b3a80a7a0e/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-8101","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/210711/546800b99100b097af3c6a2e1cd18fa0/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-605","dubId":"605","label":"Люб. Двухголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-12673","translationId":"605","url":"h